---

<Layout
  title="錦乃｜WORKS｜作品紹介"
  description="錦乃の作品一覧。江戸城や熊本城などの城郭、和風建築、和風の町並み、神社・庭園から洋風ファンタジー建築、キャラクター作品まで、幅広い制作作品を城郭を中心に、町並みや神社、武家屋敷、創作作品、図面・建築考証など錦乃の制作作品を紹介しています。"
>

<section class="bg-[#faf8f3] min-h-screen">

   <!-- Hero Image -->
<section class="relative h-[820px] overflow-hidden">

  <img
    src="/images/works-bg.jpg"
    alt="作品紹介"
    class="works-bg absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover select-none pointer-events-none"
    draggable="false"
  />

  </section>

<section class="relative overflow-hidden">

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg1.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
    draggable="false"
  />

  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-white/25"></div>

  <!-- Introduction -->

<section class="relative overflow-hidden py-20">

  <div
    class="mx-auto max-w-6xl rounded-3xl
           border border-white/40
           bg-white/10
           backdrop-blur-xl
           shadow-2xl
           px-12 py-16"
  >

    <p
      class="tracking-[0.45em] text-sm text-white"
      style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
    >
      WORKS
    </p>

    <h1
      class="mt-5 text-5xl md:text-7xl text-white"
      style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
    >
      作品紹介
    </h1>

    <p
      class="mt-10 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-10 text-white"
      style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
    >
      日本の城郭や和風建築、
      和風の町並み、神社、庭園など実在する建物や歴史考証から再現・復元した景観、
      乗り物、ファンタジー、キャラクター造形に至るまでたくさん掲載しています。
      <br />
      ぜひ、お気に入りの作品を見つけてみてください。
    </p>

  </div>

</section>

  <!-- Works List -->

  <section
    class="relative min-h-screen overflow-hidden py-32"
  >

    <div
      class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1800px] px-8"
    >


      <div class="works-grid">


        {
          works.map((work,index)=>(

            <a
              href={work.link}
              class="works-card"
              
            >


              <div class="works-image-wrap">

                <img
                  src={work.image}
                  alt={work.title}
                  loading="lazy"
                  class="works-image"
                />

              </div>


              <div class="works-body">

                <p class="works-category">
                  {work.category}
                </p>


                <h2
                  class="works-title"
                  style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
                >
                  {work.title}
                </h2>

              </div>


            </a>

          ))
        }


      </div>


    </div>


  </section>

</section>

</section>


<style>

.works-grid{

display:grid !important;

grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr) !important;

gap:20px !important;

align-items:start;

}


@media(max-width:640px){

.works-container{

padding-left:.8rem;

padding-right:.8rem;

}

}


/* Card */

.works-card{

display:block;

background:rgba(255,255,255,.78);

backdrop-filter:blur(16px);

border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.65);

border-radius:1.25rem;

overflow:hidden;

transform-style:preserve-3d;

transition:
transform .4s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1),
box-shadow .4s ease;

}


.works-card:hover{

transform:
translateY(-10px)
rotateX(4deg)
rotateY(-5deg);

box-shadow:
0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.2);

}


.works-image{

display:block;

width:100%;

aspect-ratio:1/1;

object-fit:cover;

border-radius:.9rem;

transition:transform .8s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);

}


.works-card:hover .works-image{

transform:scale(1.05);

}


.works-body{

padding:.8rem .8rem .9rem;

}


.works-category{

font-size:11px;

letter-spacing:.18em;

color:#6a6a6a;

text-transform:uppercase;

}


.works-title{

margin-top:.3rem;

font-size:1.45rem;

line-height:1.25;

color:#181818;

}



@media(max-width:760px){

.works-card{

border-radius:1rem;

}

.works-title{

font-size:.95rem;

}

}

</style>


</Layout>